        source_conflicts=['Cd table<.015 vs validatedLOQ.0015mg/kg and primary narrative<.0015.','Abstract derived-product maxima differ from narrative fraction values.','Pb benchmark and bean-versus-powder legal comparisons in exposure discussion do not establish current legal compliance or safe servings.'],
